---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: false
description: "Browse quality used cars at Kobzy in Northampton. Hand-picked, fully-checked vehicles with honest pricing, full photos and video walkarounds. Nationwide UK delivery available."
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="container hero-inner">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="hero-kicker">Kobzy · Used Cars</p>
      <h1 class="hero-title">{{ site.tagline }}</h1>
      <p class="hero-lead">Every car is hand-picked and prepared by a qualified mechanic — checked over, put right where needed, and only listed when it starts, drives and stops with no faults. {{ site.location.serviceArea }}.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="btn btn-accent" href="#stock">Browse our cars</a>
        <a class="btn btn-outline-light" href="https://wa.me/{{ site.contact.whatsapp }}?text={{ site.contact.whatsappMessage | urlencode }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">WhatsApp us</a>
      </div>
      <ul class="hero-trust">
        <li>✓ Prepared by a mechanic</li>
        <li>✓ Full working order</li>
        <li>✓ Photos &amp; video on request</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="stock">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>Our latest cars</h2>
      <p>{{ collections.availableCars.length }} vehicle{{ 's' if collections.availableCars.length != 1 }} in stock — updated regularly.</p>
    </div>

    {% if collections.availableCars.length %}
    <div class="car-grid">
      {% for car in collections.availableCars %}
        {% include "partials/car-card.njk" %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% else %}
    <p class="empty-state">No cars in stock right now — please check back soon or message us on WhatsApp to tell us what you're after.</p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-alt">
  <div class="container why-grid">
    <div class="why-card">
      <div class="why-icon">🔧</div>
      <h3>Prepared by a mechanic</h3>
      <p>Every car is inspected and put right by a qualified mechanic before it's listed. It starts, drives and stops with no faults.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="why-card">
      <div class="why-icon">📹</div>
      <h3>Photos &amp; video</h3>
      <p>Real photos and video walkarounds on every listing, plus video calls on request — buy with confidence.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="why-card">
      <div class="why-icon">💷</div>
      <h3>Fair, honest pricing</h3>
      <p>Sensibly priced against the market, with honest descriptions and no pushy sales. What you see is what you get.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="why-card">
      <div class="why-icon">🚚</div>
      <h3>UK-wide delivery</h3>
      <p>Can't make it to us? We can arrange delivery across the UK. Just ask for a quote.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section cta-band cta-band-full">
  <div class="container cta-band-inner">
    <div>
      <h2>Looking for something specific?</h2>
      <p>Tell us what you're after and your budget — we'll keep an eye out and message you when it lands.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cta-band-actions">
      <a class="btn btn-whatsapp" href="https://wa.me/{{ site.contact.whatsapp }}?text={{ 'Hi Kobzy, I am looking for a specific car.' | urlencode }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">WhatsApp Us</a>
      <a class="btn btn-outline-light" href="tel:{{ site.contact.phoneLink }}">{{ site.contact.phoneDisplay }}</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
